      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Palermo%2C_California",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Rich clay soil drew growers who planted olives, oranges, and a thriving zucca melon industry that once fed the region.",
